# Short 3, "One layer at a time" (vertical, tools/film.py --layout vertical): Night Drive in PERFORM, taken
# down to the kick alone with a solo, then built back up a solo at a time (the bass, the chords, the pings,
# the hats: all five soloed is the whole mix), the solos let go, then THROW, and DROP slamming back.
# Each `bar` prints the film's time there (the cue sheet for the labels).
turn PRESET 5 5
wait 30
expect piece 5
bar 8
wav 12-short-layers.wav
film 12-short-layers.film
bar 8 NIGHT DRIVE playing
bar 10 SEL: PERFORM
tap SEL
bar 11 black 4: the kick soloed
tapkey b3
bar 13 black 3: + the bass
tapkey b2
bar 15 black 1: + the chords
tapkey b0
bar 17 black 2: + the pings
tapkey b1
bar 19 black 5: + the hats (all five: the whole mix)
tapkey b4
bar 21 the solos let go; white 7 held: THROW
tapkey b0
tapkey b1
tapkey b2
tapkey b3
tapkey b4
key w6 down
bar 23 white 10 held: DROP
key w6 up
key w9 down
bar 25 let go: the floor slams back
key w9 up
bar 26 SEL off
tap SEL
bar 30 END
filmstop
wavstop
